                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f423a0f5-0837-456e-b880-63b675249b25",
                                                "sense_id": "1470cd53-4df8-3c79-a8e2-c6ded02f787c",
                                                "text": "Marigold and Dale have a very active love life. I am encouraging them to invest in a new bedframe."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8105561-3936-4e73-bd68-6a35ea5d5cf3",
                                                "sense_id": "1470cd53-4df8-3c79-a8e2-c6ded02f787c",
                                                "text": "William understood Diana more but idealized her less. He was privy to her volatile love life. He knew the tabloids made her life hell, but he also knew she colluded with them."
